  "body": "**What.** Measure \u03bb = 1/\u03b3 at kfreeze 15 against kfreeze 13 at D 40, 50 and 58, on quad-double-polished states. Recommended in #266's summary (its task 3).\n\n**Why.** \u03b3 is the eigenvalue of the cut problem (kfreeze 13 from D 35 on). The cut's effect on \u03bb hasn't been measured, and the quoted accuracy assumes it is below 1e-12.\n\n**Acceptance (can fail).** \u03bb(kf 15) \u2212 \u03bb(kf 13) at each D against the root's resolution, with the verdict below 1e-12 or not.\n\n**Depends on.** #266.\n",
